Comment (config.go:97):
max_concurrency is validated as positive but has no upper bound. On a large account x region fan-out a high value spawns that many goroutines each hammering the AWS APIs, risking throttling / resource exhaustion. It is clamped to len(targets) in Collect, but len(targets) itself can be large. Consider capping it at a sane maximum (and/or documenting the practical ceiling). Low priority.
